########################
# BASE
# Format: https://git-scm.com/docs/gitignore
########################

# A missing file is ignored, not lost; `git check-ignore -v <path>` says why.
*

# Without this, git never descends into a directory and later rules never run.
!*/

## Repository files
!/.editorconfig
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
!/justfile
!LICENSE
!*.code-workspace

## Stand-ins
!*.example
!*.placeholder
!*.sample
!*.template

## Documentation and data
!*.md
!*.json
!*.yml
!*.yaml
!/docs/**/.assets/**

## Temporary
.tmp/
.temp/

########################
# ASSETS
########################

!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.gif
!*.ico
!*.svg
!*.webp
!*.fig

########################
# CUSTOM
########################

# This repository's own rules, kept when the rest is resynced.

# The C# sample is documentation, not this repository's configuration.
!/src/**/.editorconfig
